<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 68 0 R
/T (When should I start hypnobirthing classes?)
/E (When should I start hypnobirthing classes?)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
158 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 68 0 R
/E (You can start your hypnobirthing whenever the hell you like, but from 20 weeks gestation. is most common to give you time to practice but the best time to come is when you feel that you are ready: hypnobirthing can still help you even in the late stages of pregnancy. However, the more time you have to practice and listen to my MP3s, the more you will benefit from the hypnotherapy and relaxation tools that you will learn.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
159 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 68 0 R
/T (What is the difference between hypnobirthing classes and antenatal classes?)
/E (What is the difference between hypnobirthing classes and antenatal classes?)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
160 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 68 0 R
/E (The primary function of hypnobirthing is to teach you how to ensure you get the best experience from your birth. So aside from just explaining the processes, we explain how to ensure your rights are adhered to and utilise your own resources to help you to relax, to be in control and feel  positive about your labour. Antenatal classes generally cover how to best look after your health during pregnancy and labour and how to look after your baby after the birth. I do that too!)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
161 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 68 0 R
/T (Who can use hypnobirthing?)
/E (Who can use hypnobirthing?)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
162 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 68 0 R
/E (Absolutely fucking anyone! Hypnobirthing is about increasing your sense of control irrespective of who you are and how your baby arrives into the world. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
